error[E300]: `UnsafeCell[Int]` does not satisfy `Sync`: it cannot be shared between threads
  --> app/t/t.kg:12:5
   |
12 |     share(r) //~ ERROR `UnsafeCell[Int]` does not satisfy `Sync`: it cannot be shared between threads
   |     ^^^^^^^

error[E300]: `UnsafeCell[Handle]` does not satisfy `Send`: it cannot move to another thread
  --> app/t/t.kg:13:5
